</div> </div> </div>Well it's a Mythic Thread, and it's a Unique Instrument, so that's -2 difficulty already.<br /> <br /> However that -2 difficulty isn't worth THAT much... it isn't a huge deal when you can get -3 difficulty just by spending more time casting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T07:26:56-07:00","id":1126695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1125827-what-s-the-point-of-being-bad?p=1126689#post1126689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well it's a Mythic Thread, and it's a Unique Instrument, so that's -2 difficulty already.<br /> <br /> However that -2 difficulty isn't worth THAT much... it isn't a huge deal when you can get -3 difficulty just by spending more time casting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or just drop some quintessence on it. You can condense quintessence out of forces in the same way you can sacrifice willing living things or objects. Get a big capacitor in your house and watch your electric bill soar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T07:27:48-07:00","id":1126696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is literally zero point to human sacrifice of an unwilling subject. You don't even get any quintessence out of it, it's just utterly pointless.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I don't know about that. I mean, In Revised Prime 3 says that the Quint taken cannot be used, but in Crusade higher levels of Prime explicitly allow to take and use Quint from your enemies. I would say there are ways.<br /> Supposedly the Quint taken from an unwilling sacrifice doesnt work because &quot;it's Resonance opposes everything that you do&quot;, but Prime 4 can cleanse Resonance. Problem solved<br /> <br /> Also the Aztec spell on Dead Magic shits on the willingness of the subject (you know, Rotes do not always follow the rules). It's a rater evil spell. I would say that evil magic may have found one or two ways to siddestep &quot;consent&quot;. Maybe that's the point of being evil","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T07:31:11-07:00","id":1126699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1125827-what-s-the-point-of-being-bad?p=1126696#post1126696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, I don't know about that. I mean, In Revised Prime 3 says that the Quint taken cannot be used, but in Crusade higher levels of Prime explicitly allow to take and use Quint from your enemies. I would say there are ways.<br /> Supposedly the Quint taken from an unwilling sacrifice doesnt work because &amp;quot;it's Resonance opposes everything that you do&amp;quot;, but Prime 4 can cleanse Resonance. Problem solved<br /> <br /> Also the Aztec spell on Dead Magic shits on the willingness of the subject (you know, Rotes do not always follow the rules). It's a rater evil spell. I would say that evil magic may have found one or two ways to siddestep &amp;quot;consent&amp;quot;. Maybe that's the point of being evil</div> </div> </div> </div>Mage. The game where you can do anything and change the very nature of reality. And somehow some old coot STILL manages to break the rules of the setting. : P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T16:07:46-07:00","id":1126868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1125827-what-s-the-point-of-being-bad?p=1126685#post1126685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is literally zero point to human sacrifice of an unwilling subject. You don't even get any quintessence out of it, it's just utterly pointless.</div> </div> </div> </div>The kind of people who use human sacrifice are the kind of people who think it is its own benefit.<br /> <br /> Albeit, I admit I'd probably have a Prime 3/Life 2 rote for giving a Point of Quintessence for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"ht